<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woolworths removing Arnotts brands.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woolworths removing Arnotts brands.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Woolworths Ltd said on Friday it was removing all Arnotts biscuits from the shelves of its stores in New South Wales, Queensland And the Australian Capital Territory following an extortion threat.  </p>
<p>A Woolworths spokesman said the removal included all brands of Arnotts biscuits, including the Sunshine brand.</p>
<p>The withdrawal affected Woolworths supermarkets, Food For Less Foodstores and Woolworths Variety stores with a food component.</p>
<p>&quot;Also we will be honouring any customer who returns product to the stores, whether it be unopened or partly used,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
